[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891299082","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106595#issuecomment-2891299082","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106595","id":2891299082,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sVbkK","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T14:42:52Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T15:23:17Z","body":"> UPDATE: Ah, wait, no this isn't ok. The strings have static lifetime .. See #106235 . It's a pain as otherwise this is a nice change.\r\n\r\nI think we may need something like [lazy_static](https://docs.rs/lazy_static/latest/lazy_static/), I'm going to try it out.\r\n\r\nEdit: This specific case seems ok because it is a local static variable and is initialized when first time this function is called (see [this](https://ddns.myredstone.top:4101/cppreference/en/cpp/language/storage_duration.html#.E9.9D.99.E6.80.81.E5.B1.80.E9.83.A8.E5.8F.98.E9.87.8F:~:text=draft%20(well%2Dformed)-,Static%20local%20variables,-Variables%20declared%20at)). I don't know if destruction will cause problem, but `String`'s destructor seems quite trival (only relys on `Memory::free_static()`), I don't think it will crash.\r\n\r\n> Do you know if this function is a bottleneck anywhere? While I think it's nice to change to a more appropriate interface, it's always good to motivate with specific goals in mind :)\r\n\r\nI haven’t checked, and I don’t think it’s a major performance bottleneck, but it’s used in syntax highlighting, so it’s probably on a hot path. Anyway, the old implementation is definitely not a good one both in readability and performance.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891299082/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891577511","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106595#issuecomment-2891577511","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106595","id":2891577511,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sWfin","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T16:12:51Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T16:12:51Z","body":"> I don't know if destruction will cause problem, but String's destructor seems quite trival (only relys on Memory::free_static()), I don't think it will crash.\r\n\r\n`Memory::free_static()` isn't currently safe to use in static destructor (there's a number of coverity results for this).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2891577511/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5256043224","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106595#issuecomment-5256043224","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106595","id":5256043224,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOUja2A","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026